{"id":"avcstat.8","n":"avcstat","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"libselinux-utils","ver":"3.6-3.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/l/libselinux-utils-3.6-3.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/avcstat.8.gz","sha256":"0903fc2340c50a16178e8260dd6fe1f48578cf604088eb91f8aa591b441b1127","date":"18 Nov 2004","origin":"dwalsh@redhat.com"},"u":{"pkg":"selinux-utils","ver":"3.3-1build2","repo":"jammy/universe","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/universe/libs/libselinux/selinux-utils_3.3-1build2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/avcstat.8.gz","sha256":"3448dd1d7a76343e384c627cbf9c05b410b276953c3ad60110774f40b7ccc734","date":"18 Nov 2004","origin":"dwalsh@redhat.com"}},"nopt":{"r":2,"u":2},"desc":"Display SELinux AVC statistics","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>avcstat - Display SELinux AVC statistics</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>avcstat</b> [<b>-c</b>] [<b>-f</b> <i>status_file</i>] [<i>interval</i>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Display SELinux AVC statistics. If the <i>interval</i> parameter is specified, the program will loop, displaying updated statistics every <i>interval</i> seconds. Relative values are displayed by default.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-c</b></dt><dd>Display the cumulative values.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-f</b></dt><dd>Specifies the location of the AVC statistics file, defaulting to <i>/sys/fs/selinux/avc/cache_stats</i>.</dd></dl>"],["AUTHOR","<p>This manual page was written by Dan Walsh &lt;dwalsh@redhat.com&gt;. The program was written by James Morris &lt;jmorris@redhat.com&gt;.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>selinux</b>(8)</p>"]]}